# Quicklist to CSV

## WTF

Quicklist CSV exports -- by design -- are not formatted correctly for direct upload to TCGPlayer.

This script will convert your Quicklist CSV into something that will work.

## WHY

* As of Oct 1 2026, the `Lists Tool` is currently broken. It is intermittently and unpredictably doubling inventory for many users.
* Quicklist works by sending a CSV to the `Lists Tool` on TCGplayer.com, which sends that data to Staging.
* TCGPlayer is currently recommending users avoid the `Lists Tool` and upload CSV directly to the `Pricing Tool`
* Quicklist CSV exports are `SKU ID` and `Qty` only. This is not enough information for CSV upload.
* In order to still use Quicklist but bypass the `Lists Tool`, we must convert Quicklist CSV to a "real" CSV. 
* This is basically what the Roca Sorter does.

