## HOW

Using this script requires:

1) Knowledge of the command line (`php main.php name-of-your-quicklist-export.csv`)
2) PHP installed locally on your machine
3) PDO supported by your PHP install
4) SQLite supported by your PHP install
5) The following database file in the same folder: https://www.mediafire.com/file/5u8lplo5kadmkj2/catalog.db/file (~86MB)

Note 1: The database is simply a catalog lookup containing Pokémon and Magic product metadata. Pricing data has been removed.

Note 2: If you don't trust the database file, you can create your own using the notes below.

